","glose":"s'effondrer, s'écrouler","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"s'effondrer, s'écrouler ; être à bout"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"大雨把旧房子冲垮了。","pinyin":"Dàyǔ bǎ jiù fángzi chōng kuǎ le.","fr":"La pluie torrentielle a fait s'effondrer la vieille maison.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"挎":{"c":"挎","pinyin":"kuà","lectures":["kuà"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","大","一","丂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-2460"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"porter au bras, en bandoulière","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"porter au bras, à l'épaule, en bandoulière"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她挎着一个包去上班。","pinyin":"Tā kuà zhe yī ge bāo qù shàngbān.","fr":"Elle part au travail, un sac à l'épaule.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"跨":{"c":"跨","pinyin":"kuà","lectures":["kuà"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","龰","大","一","丂"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0516","L7-2461","L7-2462"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"enjamber, franchir ; dépasser","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"enjamber, franchir"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"chevaucher ; dépasser les limites de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他一步跨过了小河。","pinyin":"Tā yī bù kuà guo le xiǎo hé.","fr":"D'une enjambée, il a passé le ruisseau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"块":{"c":"块","pinyin":"kuài","lectures":["kuài"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["土","夬"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0203","L1-0433","L7-0068"],"chemin":{"hsk":177,"lire":123},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"morceau, bloc, yuan (familier)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"给我一块。","pinyin":"Gěi wǒ yī kuài.","fr":"Donne-m'en un morceau.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"这本书二十块。","pinyin":"Zhè běn shū èrshí kuài.","fr":"Ce livre coûte vingt yuans.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi donne 凷, une motte de terre, et en signale une variante 塊, où 鬼 donne le son à côté de 土. La simplification a remplacé 鬼 par 夬, plus court, qui se lit guài : il rime avec kuài sans en avoir l'initiale. De la motte de terre vient le sens de « morceau », de « bloc », et à l'oral 块 sert aussi à compter l'argent.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi gives 凷, a clod of earth, and notes a variant 塊, in which 鬼 gives the sound next to 土. Simplification replaced 鬼 with the shorter 夬, read guài: it rhymes with kuài but lacks its initial. From the clod of earth comes the meaning “piece” or “lump”, and in speech 块 is also used to count money.","roles":{"土":"sens","夬":"forme"}}},"快":{"c":"快","pinyin":"kuài","lectures":["kuài"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["忄","夬"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0204","L2-0329","L2-0330","L2-0331","L2-0332","L2-0355","L3-0218","L3-0329","L3-0425","L4-0407","L4-0446","L4-0725","L5-0451","L6-0517","L6-0792","L6-0998","L7-1748","L7-2463","L7-3322","L7-3852"],"chemin":{"hsk":177,"lire":123},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rapide, bientôt, joyeux","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"快点儿！","pinyin":"Kuài diǎnr!","fr":"Plus vite !","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"快下雨了。","pinyin":"Kuài xià yǔ le.","fr":"Il va bientôt pleuvoir.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi analyse 快 comme un caractère du cœur, 心, dont 夬 donne le son, et le glose par « content ». De la joie, le sens a glissé vers l'aisance, puis vers la vitesse, aujourd'hui le plus courant. Le cœur s'écrit 忄 à gauche, et 夬, qui donnait le son, se lit aujourd'hui guài, avec une autre initiale que kuài.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi analyses 快 as a character of the heart, 心, with 夬 giving the sound, and glosses it as “pleased”. From joy the meaning shifted to ease, then to speed, now the most common sense. The heart is written 忄 on the left, and 夬, which gave the sound, now reads guài, with a different initial from kuài.","roles":{"忄":"sens","夬":"forme"}}},"筷":{"c":"筷","pinyin":"kuài","lectures":["kuài"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺮","忄","夬"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0333"],"chemin":{"lire":124},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"baguette (pour manger)","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : 筷 réunit le bambou ⺮, la matière des baguettes, et 快 kuài, qui en donne le son exact. Le caractère est tardif et absent du Shuowen jiezi, qui ne connaît pour les baguettes que 箸. Sous le bambou, on peut lire 快, rapide : deux baguettes qui portent vite la nourriture à la bouche.","en":"To remember it: 筷 combines bamboo ⺮, what chopsticks are made of, with 快 kuài, which gives its exact sound. The character is late and absent from the Shuowen jiezi, which only knows 箸 for chopsticks. Under the bamboo you can read 快, quick: two sticks that bring food swiftly to the mouth.","roles":{"⺮":"sens","忄":"son","夬":"son"}}},"宽":{"c":"宽","pinyin":"kuān","lectures":["kuān"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["宀","卄","见"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0447","L4-0448","L5-0452","L6-0518","L7-2464","L7-2465","L7-2466","L7-2467","L7-2468","L7-2469","L7-4222"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"large ; indulgent","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"large"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"indulgent, tolérant ; aisé"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这条路很宽。","pinyin":"Zhè tiáo lù hěn kuān.","fr":"Cette route est très large.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"款":{"c":"款","pinyin":"kuǎn","lectures":["kuǎn"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["士","示","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0148","L5-0176","L5-0229","L5-0346","L6-0483","L6-0674","L6-0675","L7-0237","L7-0703","L7-1207","L7-1352","L7-1750","L7-2470","L7-2471","L7-4092","L7-4625"],"chemin":{},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"somme d'argent ; modèle ; article","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"somme d'argent, fonds"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"modèle (d'un produit)"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"